Last Days in the Desert is a 2015 American drama film
written and directed by Rodrigo García.

9
01:07:50,769 --> 01:07:56,769
A variation on the biblical story of the Temptation of Christ, the film stars Ewan McGregor in a dual role of Jesus (referred to in the film as "Yeshua")
and a demon who may or may not be Satan, while Tye Sheridan, Ciarán Hinds, and Ayelet Zurer play a family they meet while in the desert.

10
01:15:23,076 --> 01:15:29,076
Last Days in the Desert premiered at the 2015 Sundance Film Festival on January
25, 2015 and was released in the United States on May 13, 2016.

11
